# M10 "Ganimet", flow "loot_rich" run 2 (PostgreSQL test database only): the warrior of run 1 was
# seeded with vo_admin - level 10, 1 234 567 Akçe, three rare Kor Çekirdeği (one stack) and an
# uncommon Bekçi Kalkanı. Shows the grouped balance and the rarity colours / tooltips in the
# inventory, then hunts Kül Çömezi (`lootfarm ... rows 2`) until a bag with at least two rows is
# open: a multi-row loot window with item tooltip, then take-all into the inventory.
# (A level-10 warrior with the starter kit cannot beat the elite Kor Bekçisi - attack 36 vs. its
# 900 hp and 38 attack - so the rare item comes from the seeding, not from its bag.)
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m10_rich
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+coinsknown+monsters 1800
expect world+level10+fullhp
scene expectcoins = 1234567
scene expectitem 11 = 3
scene expectitem 15 = 1
wait 150
# Known places for the hover (where the seeding and the starter kit put them depends on the order).
scene movestack 11 5
waitfor world+itemsidle 300
scene movestack 15 6
waitfor world+itemsidle 300
key i
waitfor world+inv 60
expecttext inv.coins 1.234.567
hoveron inv.bag.5
wait 5
expecttext inv.tooltip Kor Çekirdeği
expecttext inv.tooltip Nadir
expecttext inv.tooltip Adet: 3 / 5
screenshot 01_rich_inventory_rare.png
hoveron inv.bag.6
wait 5
expecttext inv.tooltip Bekçi Kalkanı
expecttext inv.tooltip Seyrek
screenshot 02_uncommon_tooltip.png
key i
waitfor world+invclosed 60
scene walktomonster Kül Çömezi 9
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
scene lootfarm Kül Çömezi rows 2
waitfor world+farmdone+lootwin 30000
expect world+lootcontents
scene lootlog
scene camera side 32 6
hoveron loot.item.0
wait 5
screenshot 03_multi_row_bag.png
key i
waitfor world+inv 60
key e
waitfor world+lootidle+lootwinclosed 600
scene expectcoins > 1234567
wait 4
screenshot 04_rich_taken.png
scene lootlog
quit
